  description=`Best Western Vernal Inn — workforce housing for Vernal and the Uintah Basin. Nightly from ${LOWEST_NIGHTLY}; weekly and monthly crew rates by phone. Kitchenettes, free breakfast, 0.6 miles from VEL airport. Call (435) 789-6625.`
